Package: drive-sync
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-gi, python3-watchdog
Maintainer: Bernward Weigand <bernward.weigand@posteo.de>
Description: A small utility tool for syncing a folder from a GNOME Shell desktop environment to Google Drive. The syncing is one way from the local folder to the one in google Drive.
